===Verb===
'''любить''' (ljubít’) {{impf}}, '''[[полюбить]]''' (poljubít’) {{pf.}}

# to [[love]], to [[like]], to be [[fond]] of, to grow fond of ''(more intensely than [[нравиться]])''

